# Q25 Which concept should a customer-grained KPI bind to, and why not the bare word "Customer"? (the account by default, a named role or a site when the measure is about one)
PREFIX party: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/party/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
SELECT ?rule WHERE {
  party:CustomerAccount skos:scopeNote ?rule .
  FILTER(CONTAINS(STR(?rule), "customer-grained measure binds to the customer account") && CONTAINS(STR(?rule), "by default")
         && CONTAINS(STR(?rule), "measure about one role binds to that role") && CONTAINS(STR(?rule), "measure about a location binds to the site") && CONTAINS(STR(?rule), "None binds to the bare word customer"))
}
